# IMO 2018 P1
# D on AB; E = circle(A,D) ∩ line AC.
# F on (O,A) with angle BDF = angle FBD.
# G on (O,A) with angle CEG = angle GCE.
# Prove DE parallel FG.

triangle A B C
circumcenter O C B A
on_line D A B
inter_cl E A D A C
on_circle F O A
eqangle B D F F B D
on_circle G O A
eqangle C E G G C E
prove_para D E F G
